{"3418870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ninja Baseball League-Man: Bases Loaded", "steam_appid": 3418870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Enemies, allies, and even the stage—it's ALL baseball?!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Irem's legendary 90s arcade beat 'em up is back and powered up!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418870/extras/b6f15f62b23cfedf9fb9b66a270a6ad8.poster.avif?t=1787562241\" width=620 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418870/extras/b6f15f62b23cfedf9fb9b66a270a6ad8.webm?t=1787562241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418870/extras/b6f15f62b23cfedf9fb9b66a270a6ad8.mp4?t=1787562241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆Pitch, Swing, Run! Knock 'em Out with Baseball Combat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The righteous &quot;League-Man&quot; step up to retrieve the stolen Golden Baseball Statue from the Baseball Hall of Fame!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together exhilarating combos with rapid button mashes, execute wild throw moves after grabbing opponents, and wipe out incoming enemies with flashy special moves triggered by a single button!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Pink,&quot; who was only a support character in the original, makes a long-awaited debut as a playable character. Experience newly reborn action in brilliant Full HD!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418870/extras/de52392ac880b9dde1123171459037e0.poster.avif?t=1787562241\" width=620 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418870/extras/de52392ac880b9dde1123171459037e0.webm?t=1787562241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418870/extras/de52392ac880b9dde1123171459037e0.mp4?t=1787562241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆Up to 4-Player Co-op! Packed with Modes &amp; New Minigames</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main game mode supports cooperative play for up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the game mode based on the original release, check out the high-difficulty arranged mode featuring altered enemy spawns, new placements, and brand-new stages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, the Minigame Mode includes new events! Compete for high scores in the Home Run Derby or chaotic car races!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418870/extras/561fe0c5356009309f38756ac92b8097.poster.avif?t=1787562241\" width=620 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418870/extras/561fe0c5356009309f38756ac92b8097.webm?t=1787562241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418870/extras/561fe0c5356009309f38756ac92b8097.mp4?t=1787562241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆New Arranged BGM Included! Customize Your Soundtrack!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features brand-new arranged BGM by composer Yosuke Yasui. Toggle between the original soundtrack and the new arrangements to play with your favorite tunes!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Enemies, allies, and even the stage—it's ALL baseball?!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Irem's legendary 90s arcade beat 'em up is back and powered up!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418870/extras/b6f15f62b23cfedf9fb9b66a270a6ad8.poster.avif?t=1787562241\" width=620 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418870/extras/b6f15f62b23cfedf9fb9b66a270a6ad8.webm?t=1787562241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418870/extras/b6f15f62b23cfedf9fb9b66a270a6ad8.mp4?t=1787562241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆Pitch, Swing, Run! Knock 'em Out with Baseball Combat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The righteous &quot;League-Man&quot; step up to retrieve the stolen Golden Baseball Statue from the Baseball Hall of Fame!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together exhilarating combos with rapid button mashes, execute wild throw moves after grabbing opponents, and wipe out incoming enemies with flashy special moves triggered by a single button!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Pink,&quot; who was only a support character in the original, makes a long-awaited debut as a playable character. Experience newly reborn action in brilliant Full HD!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418870/extras/de52392ac880b9dde1123171459037e0.poster.avif?t=1787562241\" width=620 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418870/extras/de52392ac880b9dde1123171459037e0.webm?t=1787562241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418870/extras/de52392ac880b9dde1123171459037e0.mp4?t=1787562241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆Up to 4-Player Co-op! Packed with Modes &amp; New Minigames</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main game mode supports cooperative play for up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the game mode based on the original release, check out the high-difficulty arranged mode featuring altered enemy spawns, new placements, and brand-new stages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, the Minigame Mode includes new events! Compete for high scores in the Home Run Derby or chaotic car races!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418870/extras/561fe0c5356009309f38756ac92b8097.poster.avif?t=1787562241\" width=620 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418870/extras/561fe0c5356009309f38756ac92b8097.webm?t=1787562241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418870/extras/561fe0c5356009309f38756ac92b8097.mp4?t=1787562241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆New Arranged BGM Included! Customize Your Soundtrack!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features brand-new arranged BGM by composer Yosuke Yasui. Toggle between the original soundtrack and the new arrangements to play with your favorite tunes!</p>", "short_description": "Throw, hit, and brawl! The legendary 90s arcade beat 'em up combining baseball and martial arts returns in HD! Packed with new characters, modes, stages, and music, plus up to 4-player co-op!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418870/0c47fc31c6c0b3e1c85fb9977684477